Text":"","stepperHidden":false,"productId":"383","features":{"title":"Key Features","items":[{"h":"Frequency Range: 4910 - 5970 MHz","c":[]},{"h":"802.11ac Wave 2 technology (2x2 MIMO/OFDM)","c":[]},{"h":"Throughput: Up to 500 Mbps real TCP/IP","c":[]},{"h":"Maximum PTP Distance: Up to 10 km","c":[]},{"h":"Integrated 16 dBi Panel Antenna","c":[]},{"h":"1x Gigabit Ethernet","c":[]},{"h":"10/100/1000 BaseT, Compatible with Cambium PoE","c":[]},{"h":"Warranty: 1 Year","c":[]}],"noExpand":false},"tabs":[{"title":"Description","active":true,"cls":"tab-2","noExpand":false,"kind":"description","html":"\n                <p data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"1151\" align=\"justify\">The <strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"825\">Cambium Networks ePMP Force 300-16</strong> is a compact and powerful wireless subscriber module built for <strong data-start=\"889\" data-end=\"919\">Point-to-Multipoint (PTMP)</strong> applications. Featuring a <strong data-start=\"946\" data-end=\"981\">16 dBi integrated panel antenna</strong>, this 5GHz radio delivers <strong data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1042\">up to 500 Mbps real throughput</strong>, offering a cost-effective and reliable solution for last-mile wireless broadband and surveillance backhaul.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1420\" align=\"justify\">Powered by <strong data-start=\"1164\" data-end=\"1183\">802.11ac Wave 2</strong> technology, the Force 300-16 supports <strong data-start=\"1222\" data-end=\"1233\">MU-MIMO</strong>, enhanced capacity, and reduced latency, even in high-interference environments. It’s perfect for <strong data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1341\">WISPs</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1368\">enterprise extensions</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1374\" data-end=\"1405\">rural internet distribution</strong> in Bangladesh.</p><p data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1420\"><br></p><h4><strong data-start=\"1433\" data-end=\"1450\">Key Features:</strong></h4><ul data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1783\"><li data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1486\">\n<p data-start=\"1453\" data-end=\"1486\">Frequency: 5GHz (5150 – 5850 MHz)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1529\">\n<p data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1529\">Throughput: Up to 500 Mbps real TCP/IP</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1530\" data-end=\"1565\">\n<p data-start=\"1532\" data-end=\"1565\">Integrated 16 dBi Panel Antenna</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1566\" data-end=\"1605\">\n<p data-start=\"1568\" data-end=\"1605\">Supports PTMP and PTP (short range)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1606\" data-end=\"1638\">\n<p data-start=\"1608\" data-end=\"1638\">802.11ac Wave 2 with MU-MIMO</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1639\" data-end=\"1683\">\n<p data-start=\"1641\" data-end=\"1683\">Low latency and high spectral efficiency</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1684\" data-end=\"1729\">\n<p data-start=\"1686\" data-end=\"1729\">Compact, weatherproof design (IP55 rated)</p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1730\" data-end=\"1783\">\n<p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1783\">Ideal for short to mid-range wireless deployments</p><p data-start=\"1732\" data-end=\"1783\"><br></p></li></ul><h4><strong data-start=\"1796\" data-end=\"1814\">Link Distance:</strong></h4>\n<ul data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1951\"><li data-start=\"1817\" data-end=\"1864\">\n<p data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1864\"><strong data-start=\"1819\" data-end=\"1845\">Maximum PTMP Distance:</strong> Up to <strong data-start=\"1852\" data-end=\"1862\">5–8 km</strong></p>\n</li><li data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1951\">\n<p data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1951\"><strong data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1887\">PTP Short Links:</strong> Up to <strong data-start=\"1894\" data-end=\"1903\">10 km</strong> (with clear line-of-sight and proper alignment)</p></li></ul><p><br></p>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Cambium Networks ePMP 5GHz Force 300-25 High-Gain 500+ M